        "content": "<p>We have <code>@[stacks]</code> to cross-reference mathlib results with the Stacks project.</p>\n<p>What other such attributes do we have? I know of <code>@[kerodon]</code> but there was definitely talk of others at some point and I don't know where to look for a definitive list.</p>\n<p>Reason I'm asking: I'm giving a talk about mathlib the library on Tuesday.</p>",
        "id": 611448563,
        "sender_full_name": "Kevin Buzzard",
        "timestamp": 1784391793
    },
    {
        "content": "<p>Tactic.CrossRefAttribute</p>",
        "id": 611448982,
        "sender_full_name": "Matthew Ballard",
        "timestamp": 1784392173
    },
    {
        "content": "<p>These seem to be the hardlinked ones: <a href=\"https://leanprover-community.github.io/mathlib4_docs/find/?pattern=Mathlib.CrossRef.Database#doc\">docs#Mathlib.CrossRef.Database</a>:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>kerodon : <a href=\"https://leanprover-community.github.io/mathlib4_docs/Mathlib/Tactic/CrossRefAttribute.html#Mathlib.CrossRef.Database\">Database</a></li>\n<li>lmfdb : <a href=\"https://leanprover-community.github.io/mathlib4_docs/Mathlib/Tactic/CrossRefAttribute.html#Mathlib.CrossRef.Database\">Database</a></li>\n<li>stacks : <a href=\"https://leanprover-community.github.io/mathlib4_docs/Mathlib/Tactic/CrossRefAttribute.html#Mathlib.CrossRef.Database\">Database</a></li>\n<li>wikidata : <a href=\"https://leanprover-community.github.io/mathlib4_docs/Mathlib/Tactic/CrossRefAttribute.html#Mathlib.CrossRef.Database\">Database</a></li>\n</ul>",
        "id": 611451023,
